    "enUS": {
      "description": "Lok'tar, {class}. Come to bond with your first wolf? Good.\r\n\r\nThere is no stronger bond than that of an orc and their wolf. They are no mere mount, but are a lifelong companion and friend.\r\n\r\nOurs is not a bond chosen by vanity. No, each orc and wolf forms a special bond that goes beyond a mere purchase.\r\n\r\nThey will choose you as much as you will choose them. You will understand when you meet them.\r\n\r\nGo and find which wolf speaks to you. Return to me when you have your answer.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Brown Riding Wolf",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
